OL,3,ATrump says all mines cleared from
OL,4,AStrait of Hormuz
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said that
OL,7,Fthe US Navy has removed or detonated
OL,8,Fall mines in the Strait of Hormuz - the
OL,9,Fvital waterway which Iran has largely
OL,10,Fclosed since the beginning of the war
OL,11,Fin the Middle East.
OL,13,F"Iran has been notified that any ship
OL,14,For boat placing new mines will be
OL,15,Fimmediately and systematically
OL,16,Fdestroyed," Trump said in a post on his
OL,17,FTruth Social platform.
OL,19,FThere is no comment from Iran.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
