OL,3,ATrump says all mines cleared from
OL,4,AStrait of Hormuz
OL,5,
OL,6,FClosure of the strait has caused wild
OL,7,Ffluctuations in the price of oil on
OL,8,Fworld markets. Trump has often said the
OL,9,FUS has control of the area - but Iran
OL,10,Fhas fired against vessels it says have
OL,11,Fsought to cross without its permission.
